# Then do_wrap returns (first_with_space_trimmed_for_output, first_with_space_for_log, visual)

# This is getting complex. Let me take a different approach:
# Change wrap_line_once to include the space in first:
# first = line[..byte_idx+1] (includes the space)
# second = line[byte_idx+1..] (starts after the space)

